<Base title="Start a project — The Opening" paper><main id="main" class="start-page"><a class="back-link" href="/"><svg class="icon-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 8H2M7 3 2 8l5 5"/></svg> The Opening</a><p class="eyebrow">A STARTING POINT, NOT A COMMITMENT.</p><h1 id="route-heading" tabindex="-1">Make room<br/><em>for an idea.</em></h1><div class="start-grid"><section><h2>Your direction</h2><p id="saved-direction">Precise</p><label for="goal">What would you like to make?</label><textarea id="goal" rows="5" maxlength="2000" placeholder="A website, an interaction, a new way to tell your story…"></textarea><p id="draft-status" role="status">Your anonymous direction stays on this device.</p><button class="button primary" id="export-draft">Export direction note <span><svg class="icon-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v12M3 9l5 5 5-5"/></svg></span></button></section><aside><h2>Contact configuration pending</h2><p>No verified email address or enquiry service was supplied. This preview cannot send enquiries. Export your direction note to keep it.</p><p>No name, email or message is collected. The full four-step brief and durable enquiry flow are a later batch.</p><a class="text-link dark" href="/#work">Explore the work <svg class="icon-arrow" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 13 13 3M3 3h10v10"/></svg></a></aside></div></main><script>import '../features/brief/start';</script></Base>
